OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly dry
OL,6,Fthis evening and overnight with clear
OL,7,Fperiods. Chance of a few brief
OL,8,Fshowers, these mostly for Shetland.
OL,9,FWindy with fresh to strong southerly
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FAfter a dry start occasionally
OL,13,Fheavy rain will spread northeast
OL,14,Fduring the afternoon and clear during
OL,15,Fthe evening. Strong occasionally gale
OL,16,Fsouth or southwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
