OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells and the odd shower on Monday,
OL,7,Ffresh southwesterly winds. Dry on
OL,8,FTuesday, strong to gale southeasterly
OL,9,Fwinds. Rain spreading northeast for a
OL,10,Ftime on Wednesday.
